title: UAC Bypass via wsreset.exe
id: eb21870f-2c14-4be3-ae29-265157c71e69
status: experimental
description: Detects the wsreset.exe UAC bypass, where the HKCU AppX ms-windows-store handler or a related class is hijacked so the auto-elevated Store reset tool runs an attacker command with high integrity.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/002/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    ParentImage|endswith: '\\wsreset.exe'
    Image|endswith:
      - '\\cmd.exe'
      - '\\powershell.exe'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - None expected
level: high
tags:
  - attack.privilege_escalation
  - attack.t1548.002
